  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "All retrieved evidence molecules consistently show low, poor, or negligible oral bioavailability in humans, including multiple quantitative absolute bioavailability values below 1%. The high assay-transfer scores and direct human data support a low prediction at the F >= 20% threshold.",
